WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
In a crowded room, you try to follow one voice.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Sometimes another voice breaks through with your name.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
In controlled studies, most listeners still missed it.

4
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Attention is selective. An experience isn't a mechanism.

5
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Zen12 advertises twelve-minute audio in multiple styles.

6
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
The minutes are real. Equivalence claims still need proof.
